me black drake scales.] and wurm [hearts:I'll retrieve some wurm hearts.] are needed most right now, and we have standing orders to eliminate any [sarnak:I'll skirmish with the sarnak.] standing between us and the gates of Gorowyn.'\nYou say, 'I'll skirmish with the sarnak.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Clearing the Way'.\nRequisitioner Olen nods curtly. 'Excellent, thank you.'\n\n---\n\nThe Combine is skirmishing with the sarnak near Gorowyn.\nKill 6 Arcron, Wulthan, or Krellnakor clan sarnak 0/6 the Skyfire Mountains\n\n---\n\n212 platinum 5 gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
