      },
      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Skyfire Mountains [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Brimshaw [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Blessed Silver-Tipped Stake [item=129918]\n- Silver-Tipped Stake [item=132275]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Droccus the Malformed [npc=53781]\n- Flogen Dax [ _Prime Elder_]\n- a hissing charger [npc=53385]\n- a hissing scavenger [npc=53386]\n- a hissing spiritist [npc=53669]\n- an ashen retainer [npc=53780]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of The Skyfire Mountains [quest=8924]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Sun Oct 29 08:22:58 2017\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | Prerequisite Quests: None.\nPraetor Brimshaw can be found in the far southwestern corner of Skyfire Mountains at -1360, +3421, -122 and his is on CTRL F find.\nThis is a shared task.\nYou say, 'Hail, Praetor Brimshaw'\nPraetor Brimshaw says, 'Welcome to the Skyfire Mountains, Gidono. The air up here would be quite thinner if it wasn't so thick with this volcanic soot,' he complains, head tilted toward the entrance with casual disapproval. 'Are you on Combine [business:What is the Combine's business here?] or just... Here for the sights?' he asks with a sneer.\nYou say, 'What is the Combine's business here?'\nPraetor Brimshaw says, 'The sarnak fortress of [Gorowyn:What do you know about Gorowyn?] lies to the north. We've established this camp to survey the [area:Have you found anything in the area?] and watch for potential attacks.'\nYou say, 'What do you know about Gorowyn?'\nPraetor Brimshaw scowls, 'A pit every bit as abysmal as these Marr-forsaken mountains, no doubt. The sarnak here are more aggressive and spiteful than ever.'\nYou say, 'Have you found anything in the area?'\nPraetor Brimshaw says, 'We've found three large magical orbs in the area. They seem to be ancient and are resonating with intense power. Investigation has been slow, however; our expeditions are being harried by ratmen. We've traced their nest back to the [graveyard:There's a graveyard here?] east of us.'\nYou say, 'There's a graveyard here?'\nPraetor Brimshaw says, 'Not just any graveyard; this one's filled with ancient dragon bones. Some kind of Veeshan thing,' he continues with a shrug. 'Regardless, it has enough [corpses:Who would make this their final resting place?] of our kind, and the ones still moving don't seem to mind [ratmen:I'll help with your ratmen problem.] very much. That's where you come in.' He regards you with a hopeful smirk.\nYou say, 'Who would make this their final resting place?'\nPraetor Brimshaw scratches his head, 'Foolhardy adventurers mostly, over the years, lured by tales of treasure and draconic artifacts. Pilgrims, too, hoping to make contact with the dragons or perhaps Veeshan herself. Did you know they think she's as large as the moon?'\nYou say, 'I'll help with your ratmen problem.'\nPraetor Brimshaw nods, 'Excellent. Now go teach those scavengers to mind their own business... and see if you can find out why they're being so aggressive.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Dragons' Graveyard'.\n\n---\n\nPraetor Brimshaw asked you to deal with the aggressive scavengers nesting in the ancient dragon graveyard to the east of the Combine's camp in Skyfire.\nKill the hissing and chattering ratment.\nMake your way to the draconic symbol in the center of the graveyard and see if you can find anything of note.\n1\\. Quell the aggressive ratment 0/6 The Skyfire Mountains\nKill Chattering or Hissing Ratmen. They are in the south central part of the zone.\n2\\. Examine the draconic symbol 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nSame area as the ratmen, in the South Central of zone - shows up on my maps as a red symbol. It's the old druid/wizard port in pad.\n3\\. Clear and examine the altar area. 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nIt is southeast from the Draconic symbol, clear the mobs around the altar (4 undead retrogenitors) and then run up to the altar for update.\n4\\. Report your finds to Praetor Brimshaw. 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nHail him for update. Praetor gives you a Silver-Tipped Stake for later use.\nIf you lose this stake, just say stake to him to get another.\n5\\. Find a knife from a ratman. 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nNot item drops, task just updates when you kill Chattering or Hissing Ratmen.\nFailed message: You search the ratman but are unable to locate a knife on this one.\nSuccess message: You search the ratman and find a simple dagger. This will work for the ritual!\n6\\. Find a coin from a ratman.\nSame as step #5.\nFailed message: You search the ratman but are unable to find a coin on this one.\nSuccess message: You search the ratman and find a scuffed coin. This will work for the ritual!\n7\\. Find a goblet from a vampire. 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nKill Ashen, Grim or Retrogenitors for update.\nFailed message:You search the vampire but are unable to find a goblet on this one.\nSuccess message: You search the vampire and find a blackened chalice. This will work for the ritual!\n8\\. Find a wand from a vampire. 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nSame as step #7.\nFailed message: You search the vampire but are unable to find a wand on this one.\nSuccess message: You search the vampire and find a bony, crimson-tipped wand. This will work for the ritual!\n9\\. Bless the stake at the vampire altar. 0/1 The Skyfire Mountains\nMake sure you clear the area first as you have to click the stake you were given. The stake casts a spell and breaks your invis/sos.\nAfter a successful bless, 4 emotes appear (you place the coin....you place the goblet.... etc.), each about 2 seconds apart, then the mobs spawn on the platform.\nSame altar as step #3. Must clear all 4 vampires. Person with Silver-Tipped Stake gets update at altar.\n10\\. Defeat Dax and Droccus.\nThey spawn on the Draconic symbol. Kill Dax and Droccus, they should have spawned in the center of the graveyard, if not you can click the Stake to spawn them, when you are not in combat. When you spawn Dax and Droccus, there will also be a third mob that spawns on the platform. Only Dax and the other mob go active at the beginning. Kill the other mob first, then get Dax to 75% and then stake him. Dax dies when you stake him and the only mob you will have left to deal with is Droccus. You might want to clear some of the mobs around the platform before you start as we got them as adds on our first attempt. If you fail you can click the stake on the platform again to re-spawn Dax and Droccus.\n11\\. Report to Praetor Brimshaw 0/1 (Skyfire Mountains)\nReturn to and Hail Praetor Brimshaw\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nExperience\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
