      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Skyfire Mountains [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Brimshaw [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 01:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Dragon's Blood [item=132257]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Servant of the Peak [npc=54637]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of The Skyfire Mountains [quest=8924]\n- The Dragons' Graveyard [quest=8849]\n- The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 30 14:36:33 2017\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** The Dragon's Graveyard [quest=8849], The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893].\nSpeak to Praetor Brimshaw in the encampment in the southwest corner of Skyfire Mountains in order to get this quest.\nYou say, 'How would I assay such a thing?'\nPraetor Brimshaw smiles, 'We've a good one for you. Take [substance:What can you tell me of their elemental substance?] from the fire and earth elementals in the lava caverns to the northwest. Pour a few drops of this precious dragon's [blood:Isn't draconic blood incredibly rare?] on them at each of the dragon heads to imbue them with Veeshan's essence, and then take the offering to the Orb and see what reaction you get.'\n**\\*Warning\\* If bags are full of the quest starter then the blood is banked. Only the one requesting the task gets one blood.** (Thanks Fayman)\nYou have been assigned the task 'The Orb of Fire'.\n\n---\n\n02. Collect 6 moltem semi-spheres. 0/6 Skyfire Mountians\nKill magmites this will update randomly on kills.\n07. Collect a seed of judgment. 0/1 Skyfire Mountians\nKill magmatic tyros or ancient volcanites, in the same areas, this will update randomly on kills.\n12. Use the blood at the western skull. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nRight click the blood you received at task request at the Western Skull.\n17. Use the blood at the northern skull. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nRight click the blood at the Northern Skull.\n22. Use the blood at the northeastern skull. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nRight click the blood at the Northeastern Skull.\n27. Use the blood at the southeastern skull. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nRight click the blood at the Southeastern Skull. Afterwards Two 'Servant of the Peak' lvl 111 Wyvern Warriors will spawn and attack. Both are mezzable/rootable.\n32. Kill the Servants of the Peak. 0/2 Skyfire Mountains\nKill the 2 mobs that spawned and attacked.\n37. Interact with the Orb of Fire. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nClick on the Orb of Fire. After you click on the orb a mob will spawn and attack.\n42. Defeat the living flames. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nKill the living flame.\n47. Speak with Apophon. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nApophon will spawn nearby. Hail it and go through its text.\n52. Report your findings to Praetor Brimshaw. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nReturn to and Hail Praetor Brimshaw. Then go through his text, this will update after some lore.\n\n---\n\nAchievements:\nPartisan of The Skyfire Mountains [quest=8924]\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain Experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 212 platinum 5 gold, Experience",
