'small'\nPraetor Magnus Auluxus says, 'Very well. Let me know when you're [ready].'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Balance of Power'.\nYou say, 'ready'\nLOADING, PLEASE WAIT...\nYou have entered Gorowyn. (instance version)\nYou can also speak to him in the instance to zone out.\nYou say, 'Hail, Praetor Magnus Auluxus'\nPraetor Magnus Auluxus beckons to you, magic in the air around him. 'If you are done, let's [disappear].'\n\n---\n\n**Quest Window Says:** The leaders of Gorowyn have bound their souls together into a grand phylactery. They will return as powerful ghosts soon after their death, unless they are all killed at the same time. You have been asked to put an end to them for good.\n01. Kill the five leaders: Dekloaz, Vimax, Wim, loulin, and Ri'zyr 0/1 Chardok\nKrellnakor Guardian Garanok [npc=53777] cons yellow to a level 105 character.\nZone in and start killing. There is a mob right at the lava bridge. After killing that one, cross the bridge to the first tower and kill the two mobs outside it. Then proceed into the top of the first tower to kill General Dekloaz.\nNow proceed west to the forge area and kill Magma Lord Virnax (outside the forge) and Forge Lord Wirn.\nNext, proceed northeast and kill the two portals called \"an Arcron portal\". Some mobs may spawn, kill those off.\nFinally, head to the northwest tower to the very top and kill High Arcron loulin. Once he dies, the dead of all the past mobs re-spawn and come after you. Kill all five to beat the mission.\nThere are occasional other adds that spawn throughout the mission, including flying drakes that cast aoe fire spells like in Skyfire Mountain. Take them all out as needed.\n07. Open the Chest 0/1 Chardok\nan iron-shod chest [npc=57664] spawns at the bridge with loot rewards.\n\n---\n\nAchievements:\nHero of Gorowyn [quest=8948]\nSorted! [quest=9017] : Kill the ghosts in the order of their proper name: Dekloaz, loulin, Ri'zyr, Vimax, Wim\nJust in Time [quest=9018] : Kill all five undying ghosts within 60 seconds of each other\nUnburnt [quest=9019] : Avoid being hit by the drakes' Cinder Sputum breath attack\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\nRewards as a level 110 character.\n637 platinum 5 gold\nYou gain experince!\n125 Bathezid Trade Gem [item=131783]\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- Bathezid Trade Gem [item=131783]",
