      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Skyfire Mountains [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Gelidalin Stormsinger [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Forgotten Blood [item=132524]\n- Hymns of Veeshan [item=132596]\n- The First Brood [item=132089]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Veeshan's Peak [RoS]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Elder Servant Kraton [npc=56469]\n- Elder Servant Obsliv [npc=56468]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Bane Bound [quest=8902]\n- For My Information [quest=8852]\n- Partisan of Veeshan's Peak [quest=8932]\n- Singing Stone [quest=8903]\n- Testing the Waters [quest=8843]\n- The Dragons' Graveyard [quest=8849]\n- The Orb of Fire [quest=8898]\n- The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893]\n- What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 30 23:12:55 2017\nModified: Sat Jan 10 22:32:33 2026 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Testing the Waters [quest=8843], For My Information [quest=8852], What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853], The Dragons' Graveyard [quest=8849], The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893], The Orb of Fire [quest=8898], State of the Sarnak [quest=8907], The Fereth [quest=8908], Chokidai Unbound [quest=8916], The Arisen [quest=8910], Trail of Discovery [quest=8911], Lay the Trap [quest=8912], Who is Buried in Sathir's Tomb? [quest=8919], Bane Bound [quest=8902], Singing Stone [quest=8903].\nThis is a shared task.\nFind Gelidalin Stormsinger in the Combine encampment in the Southwest corner of Skyfire Mountains.\nYou say, 'assistance'\nGelidalin Stormsinger says, 'I don't have anything in mind for you to do at the moment.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Songs of Old'.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Find the book called The First Brood and give it to Gelidalin. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\nGround spawn. If you look at your map it's the room directly west of Travenro's room. Also on the TOP of a bookshelf @ 1500 -180 445\n2\\. Find the book called Forgotten Blood and give it to Gelidalin. 0/1 Veeshan's Peak\nOff Elder Servant Obsliv in the same room as Travenro the Skygazer (yes he will assist if up). He spawns when you open the door and is KOS, but doesn't see invis. In the farthest NE room.\n3\\. Find the book called Forgotten Blood and give it to Gelidalin. 0/1 Skyfire Mountains\n4\\. Find the book called Hymns of Veeshan and give it to Gelidalin. 0/1 Veeshan's Peak\nOff Elder Servant Kraton in the same room as Milyex Vioren (yes he will assist if up).He spawns when you open the door and is KOS, but doesn't see invis.. In the farthest NW room approx. 1279, 1212, 772\n\n---\n\nAchievements:\nPartisan of Veeshan's Peak [quest=8932]\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n425 platinum\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
