      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Skyfire Mountains [RoS]\n**Who:**\n- Praetor Maestra [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Quest\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Loot\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Crisp Sheet of Paper [item=132120]\n- Forgeborn Scepter [item=132219]\n- Scrap of Paper [item=132216]\n- Scripture of Scale [item=132217]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Gorowyn [zone=1189]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a Kar`Zok assassin [npc=53784]\n**Related Quests:**\n- For My Information [quest=8852]\n- Partisan of Gorowyn [quest=8930]\n- Testing the Waters [quest=8843]\n- The Dragons' Graveyard [quest=8849]\n- The Orb of Fire [quest=8898]\n- The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893]\n- What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853]\n**Era:** | !Ring of Scale\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 30 23:50:51 2017\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Prerequisite Quests:** Testing the Waters [quest=8843], For My Information [quest=8852], What Makes a Scorpiki? [quest=8853], The Dragons' Graveyard [quest=8849], The Orb of Luclin [quest=8893], The Orb of Fire.\nFind Praetor Maestra in the Combine encampment in the southwest corner of Skyfire Mountains.\nPraetor Maestra says, 'Gorowyn seems to be the seat of their power. We have been unsuccessful trying to get agents into the place. It might require some brute force. I don't mean anything when I say this, but you adventurers appear to have a lot of brute force. Would you be willing to do some [tasks] for The Combine?'\nYou say, 'tasks'\nYou have been assigned the task 'State of the Sarnak'.\n\n---\n\n**Task Window Says:** We have found it nearly impossible to get agents of any sorts into Gorowyn. What we have seen, however, has us intrigued. These are not the usual sarnak, if there even is such a thing anymore. They wear a variety of outfits. We assume these are some sort of rank designation, but we don't know. If we could unravel their military hierarchy we might be better able to pick targets. We believe that the Overking of the sarnak came here after he left Chardok. You have been asked to verify this fact and perhaps discover where he resided inside Gorowyn.\nFind out about the samak that wear red and gold. 0/1 Gorowyn\nKill sarnak at specific spots, loot Scrap of Paper.\nLearn about the samak in blue and gold. 0/1 Gorowyn\nKill sarnak at specific spots, loot A Crisp Sheet of Paper.\nDiscover the secret of the samak in green and gold. 0/1 Gorowyn\nKill sarnak at specific spots, loot Scripture of Scale.\nDetermine the nature of the samak wearing white and gold. 0/1 Gorowyn\nKill sarnak at specific spots., loot Forgeborn Scepter.\nFind the location of the Overking. We will eventually need to deal with him. 0/1 Gorowyn\nFind of the 3 sarnaks or fereths in zone whose outfit does not match the one of other mobs in the area. He should be a red con at level 110. Some time after being engaged, it should emote:\n\\_\\_\\_ says, 'Enough of this. It is time for me to go.' The Overking pulls out a glowing crystal and crushes it. 'It is also time for you to die!'\nThe Overking attacks then turns into a Kar`zok assassin. Kill him.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n425 platinum\nYou gain experience!\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
