 **Task Window Text:** These 'Fereth' interest me. They seem to think they are the leaders, so we should try to find out what they have planned. Get into their headquarters and see if you can find out anything.\nKill fereths until it updates.\n2\\. Find the Fereth that wrote the Singed Note. Find out what it means. 0/1 (Gorowyn)\n> **Task Window Text:** Someone must have written that note, maybe they can tell you what it is talking about. It's certainly one of the Fereth. Find it, no matter how many times you have to hit them.\nBring any Fereth named npc down to 80% until it admits he wrote the note.\nA Fereth commander says, 'Stop! I wrote that note! I'll tell yoi what I know. We are building a [new sort] of armor. The note just informs my boss that it is nearly ready!\nYou say, 'new sort'\nA Fereth commander says, 'It is obvious that your type is dangerous and we need greater protection! As leaders it is our job to forge what our people need.' A look of fervor comes into the sarnak's eyes as he continues. 'What the need is to be united! We can't defeat our enemies until we fight as one!'\nKill him now that you had the information you were looking for. Loot the Cryptic Clans. Someone in the group gets Singed Note on the cursor.\n3\\. Bring the Singed Note to Praetor Maestra. 0/1 (Skyfire Mountains)\n4\\. Bring the Cryptic Plans to Praetor Maestra. 0/1 (Skyfire Mountains)\n> **Task Window Text:** These plans explain something. Give them to Praetor Maestra and see if she can figure it out.\n5\\. Find a sample of the Draconic Ore and delvier it to Praetor Maestra. 0/1 (ALL)\n> **Task Window Text:** Find and return a sample of this Draconic Ore to Praetor Maestra.\nDraconic Ore drops off fereths.\n6\\. Find the necklace mentioned in the Fereth plans for Praetor Maestra. 0/1 (Gorowyn)\n> **Task Window Text:** Find the necklace mentioned in the Fereth plans.\nPlatinum-Etched Necklace drops off fereths.\n7\\. Give the necklace to Praetor Maestra. 0/1 (Skyfire Mountains)\n8\\. Find a scrap of Fereth cloth for Praetor Maestra. 0/1 (Skyfire Mountains)\n> **Task Window Text:** Find some cloth from one of the Fereth to help lay the blame on them. Blame they rightly deserve.\nScrap of Fereth Cloth drops off fereths. Once done, everyone in group gets a Cloth-wrapped Necklace on their cursor.\n9\\. Plant the package Maestra gave you on a freshly killed, non-Fereth, sarnak corpse. 0/1 (Gorowyn)\n> **Task Window Text:** Kill one of the sarnak in Gorowyn that is not of the Fereth and place the items on or under its corpse.\nKill any sarnak around, target it's corpse, then right-click the Cloth-wrapped Necklace in your inventory.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n212 Platinum, 5 Gold\n**Submitted by:** Gidono",
